<title>UK: Deutsche prices $1.3 bln Daimler exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche prices $1.3 bln Daimler exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $1.3 BLN	COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY ** 12.FEB.17</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  41.065    PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES   ** CALL AFTER FIVE YEARS, PUT AFTER FIVE YEARS AT</p>
<p>	   51.298, 10 YEAR S AT 64.082 AND 15 YEARS AT 80.051</p>
<p>EXCHANGEABLE INTO ORDINARY SHARES OF DAIMLER-BENZ AG</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	PAR REDEMPTION PRICE. 13.83 PCT EXCHANGE PREMIUM.</p>
<p>		131.7 DEM EXCHANGE PRICE. 49.49 SHARES PER BOND.</p>
